{
    "title": "Feels - dating & friends",
    "description": "Tired of boring profiles that all look the same? Want to receive more exciting DMs than \"hey, how are you\"? Fed up with old rules, norms and labels? Then welcome on Feels, the feel good dating app designed for you to get tons of good vibes!\r\n\r\nMeeting your next crush, a lover or your new friends should not happen through swiping boring profile pics, that forces to judge each other based on appearance alone. We believe connection starts with natural, positive and healthy interactions, this is why Feels is designed like a social network: you scroll through profiles that are made of lively stories where everyone can express their unique personality. And if you want to chat with someone, and maybe meet IRL, all you have to do is like one of their stories, and if they do too, the Good Vibes are there and you can then chat very simply and naturally... topics won't be lacking!\r\n\r\nYOUR PROFILE, YOUR VIBE:\r\n- Say goodbye to collections of selfies! Profiles are immersive stories to show who you really are!\r\n- Unleash your creativity with videos, captions, animated stickers and Q&A to reveal your personality!\r\n- Really be yourself with all the pronoun, gender and orientation options present on the app!\r\n\r\nLET YOUR FEELINGS SPEAK:\r\n- Browse through everyone's stories to discover their vibe and personality!\r\n- Discover everyone's expectations! You can even filter to see only people with the same as you!\r\n- Like the stories of people you like. If the feeling is mutual, it's time for 'Good Vibes'!\r\n\r\nGET READY FOR GOOD VIBES:\r\n- A 'Good Vibes' is just the beginning of an easy and no pressure discussion!\r\n- Forget about \"Hi, how are you\"! Thanks to the likes on the stories, the discussion topics will flow!\r\n- Send and receive stickers and gifs in your chats to make them even more fun!\r\n\r\nYour personality is unique and you deserve a creative space to fully express yourself.  On Feels, you can meet new people, discuss anything and everything, AND make a real connection. Feel empowered to discuss your passions, hobbies, next vacation or the music festival you want to go to this summer... maybe together ;)\r\n\r\nEnjoy your conversation without pressure, because everyone is free to start or leave the discussion at any time, and in complete confidentiality.  We protect the data of our thousands of users, and prioritize safety - at any time you can switch to invisible mode where you are no longer seen by others.\r\n\r\nWHO IS TALKING ABOUT FEELS:\r\n\r\n- \"Show who you really are\" - GQ\r\n\r\n- \"We are more interested in the real people behind the profile pictures, and that is a very powerful industry pivot\" - Glamour\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nFeels is free to download and use and that will never change for our main features. However, if you're looking to get the most from Feels, you can subscribe to one of our optional subscription products.\r\n\r\nFor Premium Mode we offer 3 types of subscriptions:\r\n- Monthly subscription for $19,49/month\r\n- 6 months subscription for $47,99/6 months\r\n- 12 months subscrption for $61,99/12 months\r\n\r\nIt is possible to buy Boosts by packs with 3 offers:\r\n- 2 boosts for $6,99\r\n- 5 boosts for $11,99\r\n- 15 boosts for $26,99\r\n\r\nThe prices may vary per country and are subject to change without notice. Prices are clearly displayed in the app.\r\n\r\n* Payment will be charged to your PlayStore account at confirmation of purchase.\r\n* Your subscription will automatically renew itself, unless auto-renewal is turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the current period.\r\n* Your account will be charged for renewal within 24 hours prior to the end of the current period.\r\n* You can manage your subscriptions and turn off auto-renewal by going to your Account Settings in the Play Store.\r\n\r\nYour personal data is securely stored on Feels - read our privacy policy and terms and conditions below:\r\nhttps://www.feels-app.com/feels-privacy-policy\r\nhttps://www.feels-app.com/feels-terms-and-conditions",
    "descriptionHTML": "Tired of boring profiles that all look the same? Want to receive more exciting DMs than &quot;hey, how are you&quot;? Fed up with old rules, norms and labels? Then welcome on Feels, the feel good dating app designed for you to get tons of good vibes!<br><br>Meeting your next crush, a lover or your new friends should not happen through swiping boring profile pics, that forces to judge each other based on appearance alone. We believe connection starts with natural, positive and healthy interactions, this is why Feels is designed like a social network: you scroll through profiles that are made of lively stories where everyone can express their unique personality. And if you want to chat with someone, and maybe meet IRL, all you have to do is like one of their stories, and if they do too, the Good Vibes are there and you can then chat very simply and naturally... topics won&#39;t be lacking!<br><br>YOUR PROFILE, YOUR VIBE:<br>- Say goodbye to collections of selfies! Profiles are immersive stories to show who you really are!<br>- Unleash your creativity with videos, captions, animated stickers and Q&amp;A to reveal your personality!<br>- Really be yourself with all the pronoun, gender and orientation options present on the app!<br><br>LET YOUR FEELINGS SPEAK:<br>- Browse through everyone&#39;s stories to discover their vibe and personality!<br>- Discover everyone&#39;s expectations! You can even filter to see only people with the same as you!<br>- Like the stories of people you like. If the feeling is mutual, it&#39;s time for &#39;Good Vibes&#39;!<br><br>GET READY FOR GOOD VIBES:<br>- A &#39;Good Vibes&#39; is just the beginning of an easy and no pressure discussion!<br>- Forget about &quot;Hi, how are you&quot;! Thanks to the likes on the stories, the discussion topics will flow!<br>- Send and receive stickers and gifs in your chats to make them even more fun!<br><br>Your personality is unique and you deserve a creative space to fully express yourself.  On Feels, you can meet new people, discuss anything and everything, AND make a real connection. Feel empowered to discuss your passions, hobbies, next vacation or the music festival you want to go to this summer... maybe together ;)<br><br>Enjoy your conversation without pressure, because everyone is free to start or leave the discussion at any time, and in complete confidentiality.  We protect the data of our thousands of users, and prioritize safety - at any time you can switch to invisible mode where you are no longer seen by others.<br><br>WHO IS TALKING ABOUT FEELS:<br><br>- &quot;Show who you really are&quot; - GQ<br><br>- &quot;We are more interested in the real people behind the profile pictures, and that is a very powerful industry pivot&quot; - Glamour<br><br>---<br><br>Feels is free to download and use and that will never change for our main features. However, if you&#39;re looking to get the most from Feels, you can subscribe to one of our optional subscription products.<br><br>For Premium Mode we offer 3 types of subscriptions:<br>- Monthly subscription for $19,49/month<br>- 6 months subscription for $47,99/6 months<br>- 12 months subscrption for $61,99/12 months<br><br>It is possible to buy Boosts by packs with 3 offers:<br>- 2 boosts for $6,99<br>- 5 boosts for $11,99<br>- 15 boosts for $26,99<br><br>The prices may vary per country and are subject to change without notice. Prices are clearly displayed in the app.<br><br>* Payment will be charged to your PlayStore account at confirmation of purchase.<br>* Your subscription will automatically renew itself, unless auto-renewal is turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the current period.<br>* Your account will be charged for renewal within 24 hours prior to the end of the current period.<br>* You can manage your subscriptions and turn off auto-renewal by going to your Account Settings in the Play Store.<br><br>Your personal data is securely stored on Feels - read our privacy policy and terms and conditions below:<br>https://www.feels-app.com/feels-privacy-policy<br>https://www.feels-app.com/feels-terms-and-conditions",
